Unreleased - se7enxweb/expcomponents-authentication-database-tiein
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

- Renamed: The package is se7enxweb/expcomponents-authentication-database-tiein, Exponential's
  maintained fork of Zeta Components Authentication Database Tiein. It replaces zetacomponents/authentication-database-tiein,
  so packages that require zetacomponents/authentication-database-tiein keep working. Class names
  (ezc*) are unchanged.
- Updated: Requirements on other Zeta Components point to their Exponential
  forks (se7enxweb/expcomponents-authentication,
  se7enxweb/expcomponents-database), which replace the upstream packages.
- Updated: composer.json states the license (Apache-2.0) and the PHP
  versions; the component is tested on PHP 7.4 to 8.5.
- Added: NOTICE keeps the upstream copyright notices and names the fork;
  README.md describes the fork.
- Added: A GitHub Actions workflow running the test suite on PHP 7.4 to 8.5.


1.2 - Saturday 27 September 2014
^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

- Save and restore GET and SERVER arrays to not interfere with other tests.
- Fixed issue #13658: tutorial_autoload.php fails under Windows.
- Updated all the class diagrams.
- Fixed: Adjusted source headers of Execution to Apache license.
- Updated: Moving copyright information to NOTICE files.
- Fixed: Updated copyright dates in NOTICE files.
- Fixed #ZETACOMP-33: Many dead links (404)
- Remove custom test runner.
- Fix autoloading with composer


1.1 - Monday 17 December 2007
